SUMMARY:Simone Dinnerstein with Members of Baroklyn
DESCRIPTION:Mobile Chamber Music opens its 65th season with pianist Simone
  Dinnerstein and members of Baroklyn in an all-Bach program. The program 
 includes the Keyboard Concerto in E Major\, the Orchestral Suite No. 2 in
  B Minor and the Brandenburg Concerto No. 5\, plus two chorale works arra
 nged by Dinnerstein and Baroklyn. The concert is a Sunday matinee at the 
 Laidlaw Performing Arts Center on the University of South Alabama campus.
